==English==
===Verb===
'''[[give]] (somebody ''or'' someone) the [[time]] of [[day]]'''

#{{idiom}} To [[acknowledge]] somebody; to give somebody any respect or attention.
#:''If he doesn't think you are rich enough, he won't even '''give you the time of day'''.''

====Usage notes====
*'''Give somebody the time of day''' is usually used in the [[negative]].